# The checks stage (T46) builds from this context, so `test/` has to stay in it: without the
# tests `npm test` finds no files and exits 1, which reads exactly like a failing suite (E6).
# The runtime stage copies `src`, `drizzle` and the start files by name, so nothing here
# reaches the shipped image anyway.
node_modules
dist
data
.env
docs/reviews/screenshots
eval/receipts
